@startuml
title Communication: GET /api/items (message flow)

object "Browser\n(app.js: loadItems())" as Browser
object "Items API\n(handleItems())" as ItemsAPI
object "getItems()" as GetItems
object "getPool()" as GetPool
object "Azure SQL\n(appdb)" as Sql

Browser --> ItemsAPI : 1: GET /api/items
ItemsAPI --> GetItems : 1.1: getItems()
GetItems --> GetPool : 1.1.1: getPool()
GetPool --> Sql : 1.1.1.1: connect()\n[poolPromise undefined]
GetItems --> Sql : 1.1.2: batch(lock, create, seed, select)
ItemsAPI --> Browser : 2: 200 OK, jsonBody: DemoItem[]\n(or 500 on error, items.ts:95-100)

@enduml
